sen0401:LegacyContent_2025 a schema:Collection ;
    dcterms:title "The owner's 2025 course content: reports, prompts, ontologies, pages, games and book text" ;
    cme:fileInPart "03-materials/owner-legacy-2025/legacy_inventory_v1_0_0.json" ,
                   "03-materials/owner-legacy-2025/ATTRIBUTION_v1_0.md" ;
    rdfs:comment "144 files, imported byte-identical under versioned names, each with its original name, SHA-256, size, role and - where one was measured - the third-edition chapters its text matches. The inventory is the register of record for the collection; its individual files are not listed here one by one, because the inventory already states for each one what this register would have to repeat. It includes a PDF of the second edition and plain-text copies of its chapters, which the attribution file licenses as CC BY-SA 4.0 after verifying the authors' repository README at commit 275c4eb on 2026-09-27."@en ;
    dcterms:source "03-materials/owner-legacy-2025/legacy_inventory_v1_0_0.json, written 2026-09-27T08:38:41, and 03-materials/owner-legacy-2025/ATTRIBUTION_v1_0.md." ;
    dcterms:rights "CC BY-SA 4.0 as far as the collection contains the book's text, per the attribution file." .
